Subject: [PATCH v2] sh: boards: Replace <linux/clk-provider.h> by <linux/of_clk.h>
Date:   Wed, 19 Aug 2020 14:35:48 +0200
Message-Id: <20200819123548.19350-1-geert+renesas@glider.be>
